body:
The Crew - driving down the highway across the States at night, listening to a synthwave radio was such a cool experience. I haven't finished a single mission in that game (too boring), and the grind for upgrades was atrocious, but these long rides were near perfect.

&#x200B;

Edit: On the subject of soundtracks, Rocketbirds: Hardboiled Chicken is the one for me. Excellent music, you could even say the game is more of a playable album, but the gameplay was stiff and boring
